ration? | `B6` lifecycle agreement and handoff; [the amended contract](design/admission-use-lifecycle.md#44-redemption-and-admission-commits) makes the issuer's exclusive limit a trusted input and checks it at one redemption instant; independent re-review precedes Zorg fit assessment; live renewal remains outside this slice |"],["| Do both owners adopt the proposed per-use observation handle and conservative observed-close grace rule? | `B6` production issuer reclamation acceptance; [the review handoff](reviews/admission-acquisition-review.md#4-next-action-and-zorg-handoff) places timing repair and re-review before issuer transaction fit and joint agreement; complete-snapshot alternatives remain visible and the B51 design verdict is unchanged |","| Do both owners adopt the proposed per-use observation handle and conservative observed-close grace rule? | `B6` production issuer reclamation acceptance; [the amended handoff](design/admission-use-lifecycle.md#9-remaining-decisions-and-handoff) places independent re-review before issuer transaction fit and joint agreement; complete-snapshot alternatives remain visible and the B51 design verdict is unchanged |"]];
